  "question": "白噪声 n(t)（N_0/2）通过理想低通 |H(f)|=1（|f|≤W），0 否则。求输出噪声功率与输出自相关 R_y(τ)。",
  "answer": "P_y=N_0 W；R_y(τ)=N_0 W·sinc(2Wτ)（或 N_0 sin(2πWτ)/(2πτ)）。",
  "techniques": [
    "白噪声通过滤波器",
    "PSD 积分",
    "sinc 傅里叶对"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "s1",
        "text": "S_y(f)=|H(f)|^2·N_0/2 ⇒ 输出功率 ∫_{−W}^W N_0/2 df=N_0 W"
      },
      {
        "id": "s2",
        "text": "R_y=F^{-1}{S_y}=N_0∫_{−W}^W e^{j2πfτ}df/2 = N_0 sin(2πWτ)/(2πτ)。"
      }
    ],
    "final_answer": "P_y=N_0 W；R_y(τ)=N_0 W·sinc(2Wτ)（或 N_0 sin(2πWτ)/(2πτ)）。",
    "techniques_used": [
